OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA ridge of
OL,6,Fhigh pressure will topple across from
OL,7,Fthe west bringing a settled and dry
OL,8,Fnight across the region with clear
OL,9,Fspells. Turning chilly in some rural
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FThursday will start fine
OL,13,Fwith some pleasant spells of sunshine.
OL,14,FCloud slowly increasing from the west
OL,15,Fthough with rain arriving later in the
OL,16,Fday. Becoming breezy too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
