OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBrighter
OL,6,Fweather returns on Friday, with
OL,7,Fsunshine and occasional light showers.
OL,8,FA spell of wind and rain is likely on
OL,9,FSaturday, ahead of brighter skies with
OL,10,Fshowers on Sunday.
